At Life in Argentina, we help U.S. citizens connect the legal requirements with the practical decisions involved in moving here. That starts with identifying the appropriate residence category and reviewing what the income documents actually prove.

We can organize the Argentine application, help coordinate U.S. document preparation, assist with filing and follow-up, and plan related family applications. Where the move raises U.S. benefits, tax, or specialist healthcare questions, those need input from the appropriate professionals alongside the immigration work.

